Package: lumo-tools
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Lumo OS Team <salom600@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0,
 lumo-theme, swaylock, brightnessctl, pulseaudio-utils, network-manager,
 bluez, polkitd, pkexec
Description: Lumo OS shell tools (launcher, quick settings, calendar, power)
 Interactive GTK4 layer-shell components of Lumo Shell: the full-screen
 application launcher with instant search, the Quick Settings control
 center (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Game Mode, volume, brightness), the calendar
 popup, the power dialog, the welcome window and the Game Mode governor
 helper. Every control drives a real system backend.
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/salom600/lumo-os
